{"3598950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catfish Idle Pond", "steam_appid": 3598950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join an adorable cat companion on a desktop idle fishing adventure! Watch as your feline friend casts its line and collects a wide variety of fish to fill your growing log. Earn money from selling the catch to purchase upgrades and personalize your island with cosmetics. Sit back and enjoy ambiance while your cat does all the fishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598950/extras/dd003f73d56e4237191fca5cfe1568bb.poster.avif?t=1762741132\" width=600 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598950/extras/dd003f73d56e4237191fca5cfe1568bb.webm?t=1762741132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Log Caught Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of the fish your little cat buddy catches! The size, strength, and quality of each fish play a crucial role in determining its value. Unlock all types of fish to enhance your cat's fishing skills, allowing them to catch higher-quality fish more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598950/extras/d9239a8a396820fd4133129464b70cf0.poster.avif?t=1762741132\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598950/extras/d9239a8a396820fd4133129464b70cf0.webm?t=1762741132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate your island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 